# maat — VAULT HA PAIR (crown jewels). Login user maam has PASSWORD sudo: apply
# needs an operator session that can answer the prompt (not headless-able today).
# Same vault rules as wadjet: firewall only, never touch listen_addresses, apply on
# the standby first, detached systemd-run, HA replication path from recon as EXTRA.
LAN_IFACE=TBD-from-recon
LAN_SUBNET=192.168.8.0/24
DHCPV6=no
# EXTRA4=-i <iface> -p tcp --dport <vault-port> -s <wadjet-addr>/32 -j ACCEPT  # vault HA peer
